  members: ModuleDoc ModuleDocComment 0..96 "//! Storage for a value that is not there yet (spec 05, section 6): `lang.mem.Uninit(T)` has the"
  members: ModuleDoc ModuleDocComment 97..194 "//! size and alignment of a `T`, owns nothing, and holds a `T` only once one is written through a"
  members: ModuleDoc ModuleDocComment 195..269 "//! pointer. A vector over it needs no value of `T` to fill its room with."
